                </div>
                <ul className="text-xs sm:text-sm text-signal-dark space-y-2 mb-4 font-sans">
                  <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <ChevronRight className="w-4 h-4 text-signal-blue shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
                    <span>Conception d'interfaces réactives avec React, Tailwind CSS et Next.js.</span>
                  </li>
                  <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <ChevronRight className="w-4 h-4 text-signal-blue shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
